# Community Cultural Festival Management System – User Manual

## Getting Started

1. **Launch the Application**: Open the solution file in Visual Studio and run the project.
2. **Main Interface**:
   - Enter participant name and contact information.
   - Choose a cultural category (Music, Dance, Art, Culinary, etc.).
   - Input category-specific data (e.g., dance style, instruments, stage requirements).
   - Click "Register" to save the participant.
   - Click "View Participants" to see a summary.

## Key Functionalities

| Action                  | Description |
|------------------------|-------------|
| Register Participant   | Saves participant data with validation |
| View All Participants  | Displays all registered participants in a list |
| Calculate Fees         | Sums up all registration fees |
| Search by Name         | Finds participant by name |

